        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Émile Driant\n- Events: Battle of Verdun, First World War\n- Places: Western Front\n- Countries: Germany, France\n\nFacts:\n- The Battle of Verdun was fought between the German and French armies on the Western Front from 21 February to 18 December 1916.\n- The Battle of Verdun was the largest and longest battle of the First World War on the Western Front.\n- Émile Driant was the first high-ranking casualty in the Battle of Verdun.\n- The chunk states that the Battle of Verdun had 112 fatalities in total.",
